{"unit_id":"MeteorNOX__dsh-whale-bongo#card-zh","repo":"MeteorNOX/dsh-whale-bongo","commit":"47be039b7d8b7c4f8db42ed271099d8db0bdb3f2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-whale-bongo 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的打字互动挂件，会显示在输入框旁并随键盘输入做双手按压动画。它通过 DSH 客户端模块挂载浏览器组件，并由 Host 提供组件脚本、图片和键位数据路由。用户可以调整图片与手部外观、音效、尺寸、打字角度和吸附位置，也能通过鼠标按压角色；可选桌面模式可将挂件显示为独立 Electron 窗口。适合希望给 DSH 输入过程增加可定制动画宠物的用户。核心页面挂件不需要 API Key，桌面模式需 Electron。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1-17","assets/widget.js:4109-4137","index.js:164-180","index.js:218-253"]}
{"unit_id":"MeteorNOX__dsh-whale-bongo#card-en","repo":"MeteorNOX/dsh-whale-bongo","commit":"47be039b7d8b7c4f8db42ed271099d8db0bdb3f2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-whale-bongo is a customizable typing pet beside the DSH web composer. Keyboard input animates its hands; users can change its image, appearance, sound, size, angle, and position. An optional Electron mode opens it in a desktop window. No API key is needed for the web widget.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1-17","assets/widget.js:4109-4137","index.js:164-180","index.js:218-253"]}
